diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 1a55755..04e2a50 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,7 +6,16 @@ In-memory inventory service. `api.handle(request)` maps a request
 
 ## Endpoints
 
-- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...]}`: every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...], "next_cursor": "<string>" | null}`: one page
+  of items, ordered by `id` ascending.
+  - Query params (both optional):
+    - `limit`: integer `1`..`100`, default `20`.
+    - `cursor`: opaque string, copied unchanged from a previous response's
+      `next_cursor`. Omit it for the first page.
+  - `next_cursor` is `null` on the last page; otherwise pass it back as `cursor`
+    to get the following page.
+  - 400 with `{"error": "..."}` when `limit` is not an integer or is outside
+    `1`..`100`, or when `cursor` is not a valid cursor.
 - `GET /items/<id>` → the item, 404 when unknown, 400 when `id` is not a number.
 
 Run the tests with `python3 -m unittest`.
